{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#card-zh","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 网页界面更换字体。它在设置→常规中注册字体设置行，提供界面字体与代码字体两个选择器，支持分组选项、预览和即时应用，并将选择保存在浏览器 localStorage，刷新后可恢复。界面字体通过中西文搭配的系统字体栈覆盖网页字体变量，代码字体单独调整代码显示。适合希望自定义 DSH 阅读与编码外观的网页用户；需要在本机安装想使用的字体，无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:509-515","client.js:417-450","client.js:293-300","client.js:241-270"]}
{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#card-en","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-font lets DSH web users choose separate interface and code fonts. Settings → General offers grouped selectors and a preview; choices apply immediately and persist in localStorage. It uses local system fonts, which must be installed. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:509-515","client.js:417-450","client.js:293-300","client.js:241-270"]}
