{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#feature-font-selectors","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font 的功能「分别选择字体」：在设置→常规的字体行中，用户可分别选择界面字体和代码字体；选项带分组并显示字体预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:417-450","client.js:509-515"]}
{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#feature-live-apply","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font 的功能「即时应用」：选择字体后立即更新对应 CSS 字体变量，让网页界面或代码区域使用所选字体；选择默认项会清除覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:293-300","client.js:519-529"]}
{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#feature-persistence","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font 的功能「保存字体选择」：插件将界面和代码字体 ID 分别写入浏览器 localStorage，并在启动时读取和校验，刷新后可恢复选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:241-270","client.js:521-529"]}
{"unit_id":"WangPaoPaoLab__dsh-font#caveat-system-fonts","repo":"WangPaoPaoLab/dsh-font","commit":"d299f56bde1e10e7fef152848e74cff2eecd7917","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font 使用本机字体栈且不内置字体文件；希望使用的字体需已安装，缺失时会由栈中的后续字体替代。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:45-57","client.js:13-16"]}
